analyzer.output_format:
輸出包含完整分析的 JSON 物件：
{
  "method_analysis": {
    "gptq": {"trials": N, "success_rate": X, "avg_accuracy": Y, "avg_gpu": Z, "observations": "..."},
    "awq": {"trials": N, "success_rate": X, "avg_accuracy": Y, "avg_gpu": Z, "observations": "..."},
    "bnb": {"trials": N, "success_rate": X, "avg_accuracy": Y, "avg_gpu": Z, "observations": "..."}
  },
  "failure_patterns": [
    {"pattern": "描述", "affected_params": {...}, "suggestion": "避免/調整"}
  ],
  "success_patterns": [
    {"pattern": "描述", "winning_params": {...}, "trade_off": "準確率 vs 壓縮率"}
  ],
  "parameter_insights": {
    "bits": "關於 bits 影響的觀察",
    "group_size": "關於 group_size 影響的觀察",
    "other": "其他值得注意的發現"
  },
  "unexplored_regions": [
    {"method": "...", "params": {...}, "rationale": "基於以上分析，為何有潛力"}
  ],
  "recommendations": ["策略建議 1", "策略建議 2"]
}

僅輸出 JSON 物件（不要有其他文字）。

planner.output_format:
以 JSON 格式提供你的決策：

{
  "strategy": "exploration" / "exploitation" / "balanced",
  "next_config": {
    "method": "gptq" / "awq" / "bnb",
    "bits": ...,
    "group_size": ...,
    ...（從搜尋空間中選擇的所有相關參數）
  },
  "rationale": "解釋你選擇此配置的原因（2-3 句話）",
  "confidence": 0.0-1.0
}

僅輸出 JSON 物件（不要有其他文字）。
